# Phase discipline

Follow `docs/roadmap.md`. Do not pull later-phase work into the current phase.

| Phase | Focus |
|-------|--------|
| 2 | Persist postings, event append/replay, real `verify` |
| 3 | Import → ledger write, adapters, golden fixtures |
| 4 | Dedupe + rules DSL + metrics |
| 5 | Reconcile proofs + `why` |
| 6 | Beancount polish + demo |
| 7 | Fuzz, benches, eval chapter |

**Out of scope for v1:** mobile UI, budgeting UI, PDF/OCR spine, tax, multi-user sync, “AI categorizes everything”.

Prefer failing tests and design-doc updates over new product surfaces.
